@startwbs
' Source (synthetic brief): the bookshop's daily sales report showed zero revenue on 2026-05-04.
' Data: the till CSV arrived with a new column order (vendor change ticket TILL-12). Process: the load
' step has no schema check (runbook step 3 skips it). Tooling: the row-count alert compares counts, not
' sums (alert config). The report was published because the count check passed AND no sum check
' exists. Not stated: who approved the vendor change.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
legend { BackgroundColor transparent; LineColor $LEGEND_FRAME }
wbsDiagram {
  .data { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD }
  .process { BackgroundColor #E8F5E9 }
  .tooling { BackgroundColor #FFF3E0 }
  .people { BackgroundColor #F3E5F5 }
  .failure { BackgroundColor #FADBD8 }
  .gate { BackgroundColor #FFFFFF; LineThickness 2 }
}
</style>
' house-preamble-end

title Cause tree for the zero-revenue sales report of 2026-05-04 (synthetic)

* Daily sales report shows zero revenue <<failure>>
** Data <<data>>
*** Till CSV columns reordered\n//evidence: vendor ticket TILL-12//
** Process <<process>>
*** Load step has no schema check\n//evidence: runbook step 3//
*** Vendor change approval\n//evidence: not stated//
** Tooling <<tooling>>
*** AND: published anyway <<gate>>
**** Row-count check passed\n//evidence: alert log 2026-05-04//
**** No revenue-sum check\n//evidence: alert config//

legend bottom
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  |<#FADBD8>| the problem |
  |<#E3F2FD>| data cause |
  |<#E8F5E9>| process cause |
  |<#FFF3E0>| tooling cause |
  | bold box "AND:" | both causes below it were needed (OR: either one) |
  | //italic line// | the evidence for the cause |
endlegend
@endwbs
